 your Pokémon to\\nthe Pokémon Center.","msg_0375_R30_00004":"I’m not a Trainer.\\rBut if you look one in the eyes,\\nprepare to battle.","msg_0375_R30_00005":"Hey, kiddo!\\rHow in the world can you be so\\noblivious to my eye-catching house?\\fHold it right there!\\r","msg_0375_R30_00006":"When you follow that path up north,\\nyou will see Mr. Pokémon’s house.\\rBut before you go, let me finish what\\nI have to say.\\rDo you...have any Apricorns?\\fApricorn trees bear fruit once a day.\\fI have one of those trees, too!\\rApricorns are really something.\\nYou can make Poké Balls and\\fother things.\\rThey are quite useful.\\rI have a feeling this is meant to be,\\nbecause I have something for you!\\r","msg_0375_R30_00007":"","msg_0375_R30_00008":"With that Apricorn Box, you can carry\\nso many Apricorns.\\rYou’ll be a decent Apricorn collector!\\r","msg_0375_R30_00009":"Rt. 30\\nSouth to Cherrygrove City","msg_0375_R30_00010":"Mr. Pokémon’s House\\nStraight Ahead!","msg_0375_R30_00011":"Mr. Pokémon’s House","msg_0375_R30_00012":"Trainer Tips\\rNo stealing other people’s Pokémon!\\rPoké Balls are to be thrown only at\\nwild Pokémon!","msg_0375_R30_00013":"Oh! You’re wearing the Running Shoes.\\rThey make you feel like you are flying,\\ndon’t they?\\rBut beware of wild Pokémon and\\nTrainers!\\rWhen you run, the noise will\\nattract them."},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_SCENE_ROUTE_30_OW","value":2,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_R30_001 + 1"}],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R30_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_R30_010":10,"obj_R30_gsman1":0,"obj_R30_gsgirl2":1,"obj_R30_tree":2,"obj_R30_gsboy3":3,"obj_R30_gsboy2":4,"obj_R30_gsboy2_2":5,"obj_R30_tsure_poke_static_rattata":6,"obj_R30_tsure_poke_static_pidgey":7,"obj_R30_gsboy2_3":8,"obj_R30_monstarball":9,"obj_R30_monsta